hadron-tx-verifier
==================

This project is a fork of multisig-verifier:

  https://github.com/Solana-Multisig-Tools/multisig-verifier
  (forked at commit ccf3b5b, 2026-08-20)
  Copyright (c) 2025 Squads Labs, Inc.
  Dual-licensed under MIT and Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-MIT / LICENSE-APACHE).

The full upstream git history is preserved in this repository so the changes
made in this fork can be audited with:

  git diff upstream/main...HEAD

Modifications for Hadron (transaction paste-and-decode input mode, Hadron /
fee-share / Squads v4 / BPF-loader instruction decoders generated from the
audited Hadron IDL, balance-change simulation, red-flag heuristics, removal of
the wallet signing flow) are:

  Copyright (c) 2026 Hadron
  Dual-licensed under the same MIT and Apache-2.0 terms.

This tool is verification-only: it never connects to a wallet and cannot sign
or send transactions.

